    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but even if i do write something, it just feels like i'm trying to decorate a void. i've been thinking about this idea for the final track... that maybe the only way to actually capture something truly raw and honest is through an act of total destruction. like, if you can't find the feeling, you have to become the end of it. does that sound too dark or is there something more profound in that sink or swim kind of thing?",
